{"id":"bOWlURHD4MnS","time":1778210987,"expires":1778254187,"event":"message","topic":"judy-alerts","message":"🟢 New FB Post Detected 🟢\n\nGroup: China Sourcing Agent | Shopify Dropshipping | 1688 \u0026 Alibaba Suppliers\nPosted By: Lê Mạnh Hùng\nPoster URL: https://m.facebook.com/lmh2882002/\nPost Type: regular_post\nPost URL: https://m.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684/permalink/1600383774355047/\n\nPost Text:\nHi, I'm looking for a reliable shipping agent in China for my dropshipping model.\n\nI run an online reseller on Google and I have orders in stock. You can package the products and process the orders.\n\nMy main priorities are:\n\n• Fast shipping to the US (ideally around 5-10 days)\n\n• Shipping NOT like AliExpress\n\n• Quality checks before shipping\n\n• Ability to source products for me\n\n• No MOQ (can ship directly to customers on a per-order basis)\n\nMy order volume may vary depending on sales as I'm currently scaling, but I want to build a long-term relationship.\n\nRegarding payment, I'd like to work on a **per-order processing basis** (e.g., around $1-3 per completed order) rather than hourly rates. If possible, please let me know:\n\n• Average shipping time to the US\n\n• Which shipping carriers do you use (YunExpress, 4PX, etc.)?\n\n• Do you support dropshipping with no minimum order quantity (no-MOQ) and product sourcing?\n\nI have attached an example of the product I need.\n\nI look forward to your ...","priority":5,"actions":[{"id":"nhYkEuidge","action":"view","label":"Open","clear":false,"url":"https://m.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684/permalink/1600383774355047/"},{"id":"XyifjxxcRC","action":"copy","label":"Copy post","clear":false,"value":"Groups Watcher\nGroup Name: China Sourcing Agent | Shopify Dropshipping | 1688 \u0026 Alibaba Suppliers\nGroup URL: https://www.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684\nPoster Name: L� M?nh H�ng\nPost URL: https://m.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684/permalink/1600383774355047/\n\nPost Text:\nHi, I'm looking for a reliable shipping agent in China for my dropshipping model.\n\nI run an online reseller on Google and I have orders in stock. You can package the products and process the orders.\n\nMy main priorities are:\n\n? Fast shipping to the US (ideally around 5-10 days)\n\n? Shipping NOT like AliExpress\n\n? Quality checks before shipping\n\n? Ability to source products for me\n\n? No MOQ (can ship directly to customers on a per-order basis)\n\nMy order volume may vary depending on sales as I'm currently scaling, but I want to build a long-term relationship.\n\nRegarding payment, I'd like to work on a **per-order processing basis** (e.g., around $1-3 per completed order) rather than hourly rates. If possible, please let me know:\n\n? Average shipping time to the US\n\n? Which shipping carriers do you use (YunExpress, 4PX, etc.)?\n\n? Do you support dropshipping with no minimum order quantity (no-MOQ) and product sourcing?\n\nI have attached an example of the product I need.\n\nI look forward to your reply."}]}
