{"id":"w9hpVtRoEDnJ","time":1778236111,"expires":1778279311,"event":"message","topic":"judy-alerts","message":"🟢 New FB Post Detected 🟢\n\nGroup: China Dropshipping Suppliers \u0026 Manufacturers\nPosted By: Lemuel Tolentino\nPoster URL: https://m.facebook.com/josephlemuel.tolentino.3/\nPost Type: regular_post\nPost URL: https://m.facebook.com/groups/aliexpressdropshippers/permalink/2117488792508601/\n\nPost Text:\nHi everyone,\nI am looking for a reliable, English-speaking Sourcing Agent / Freight Forwarder based in China (Guangzhou/Shenzhen area) for a long-term business relationship.\n\nMy Requirements:\n1. Sourcing \u0026 Consolidation: Ability to source from 1688, Weidian, and local markets.\n2. Quality Control: Detailed QC (High-res photos and videos) is mandatory before shipping.\n3. Logistics: Must provide Air DDP (Delivered Duty Paid) lines to France with stable customs clearance.\n4. Security \u0026 Payment: For the first orders, I strictly require payment via Alibaba Trade Assurance to ensure a secured transaction. For future orders, I am open to Wise/Revolut. No direct bank transfers or Western Union for initial trials.\n5. Complete certification and compliance with in-depth knowledge of China and Philippines vape regulations.\n\nI am looking for a partner who is responsive on WhatsApp  and can handle small to medium volumes (starting 15-25kg) with a view to scale.\nPlease DM me with:\n• Your service fee p...","priority":5,"actions":[{"id":"jEOXXEpRHA","action":"view","label":"Open","clear":false,"url":"https://m.facebook.com/groups/aliexpressdropshippers/permalink/2117488792508601/"},{"id":"wyFmUfcExG","action":"copy","label":"Copy post","clear":false,"value":"Groups Watcher\nGroup Name: China Dropshipping Suppliers \u0026 Manufacturers\nGroup URL: https://www.facebook.com/groups/762376298019864\nPoster Name: Lemuel Tolentino\nPost URL: https://m.facebook.com/groups/aliexpressdropshippers/permalink/2117488792508601/\n\nPost Text:\nHi everyone,\nI am looking for a reliable, English-speaking Sourcing Agent / Freight Forwarder based in China (Guangzhou/Shenzhen area) for a long-term business relationship.\n\nMy Requirements:\n1. Sourcing \u0026 Consolidation: Ability to source from 1688, Weidian, and local markets.\n2. Quality Control: Detailed QC (High-res photos and videos) is mandatory before shipping.\n3. Logistics: Must provide Air DDP (Delivered Duty Paid) lines to France with stable customs clearance.\n4. Security \u0026 Payment: For the first orders, I strictly require payment via Alibaba Trade Assurance to ensure a secured transaction. For future orders, I am open to Wise/Revolut. No direct bank transfers or Western Union for initial trials.\n5. Complete certification and compliance with in-depth knowledge of China and Philippines vape regulations.\n\nI am looking for a partner who is responsive on WhatsApp  and can handle small to medium volumes (starting 15-25kg) with a view to scale.\nPlease DM me with:\n? Your service fee percentage.\n? Current Air DDP rates to Philippines per kg.\n? Your WeChat/WhatsApp contact.\nScammers and amateurs, please don?t waste my time. I am looking for a professional and transparent partner."}]}
