{"id":"1BzJVdGbHnGd","time":1778241654,"expires":1778284854,"event":"message","topic":"judy-alerts","message":"🟢 New FB Post Detected 🟢\n\nGroup: China Sourcing Agent | Shopify Dropshipping | 1688 \u0026 Alibaba Suppliers\nPosted By: MD Abdur Rahman Nayem\nPoster URL: https://m.facebook.com/md.abdur.rahman.nayem.587968/\nPost Type: regular_post\nPost URL: https://m.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684/permalink/1600704987656259/\n\nPost Text:\nHey guys, need some real advice.\n\nI’m running an Amazon USA FBA Wholesale business and planning to move to China for a full year. I want to stay there, work directly with suppliers, source new products, and grow the business.\n\nI have some major concerns though. Would really appreciate honest feedback from those who are currently running or have run Amazon FBA while living in China.\n\nHere’s what I want to know:\n* Is it risky to manage Seller Central from China? Any IP issues, account suspension problems, or login restrictions? How safe is using VPN?\n* Can I pay suppliers using Wise or PayPal while being in China? What’s the best and safest way to send money to suppliers from China?\n* What visa is best if I want to stay for one year?\n* What other big challenges or problems should I expect while running Amazon FBA from China?\n\nIf you have actual experience doing this, please share in the comments. It would help me a lot.\n\nThanks in advance!","priority":5,"actions":[{"id":"KAFKT42xQh","action":"view","label":"Open","clear":false,"url":"https://m.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684/permalink/1600704987656259/"},{"id":"N4knMU0BRK","action":"copy","label":"Copy post","clear":false,"value":"Groups Watcher\nGroup Name: China Sourcing Agent | Shopify Dropshipping | 1688 \u0026 Alibaba Suppliers\nGroup URL: https://www.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684\nPoster Name: MD Abdur Rahman Nayem\nPost URL: https://m.facebook.com/groups/1278247436568684/permalink/1600704987656259/\n\nPost Text:\nHey guys, need some real advice.\n\nI?m running an Amazon USA FBA Wholesale business and planning to move to China for a full year. I want to stay there, work directly with suppliers, source new products, and grow the business.\n\nI have some major concerns though. Would really appreciate honest feedback from those who are currently running or have run Amazon FBA while living in China.\n\nHere?s what I want to know:\n* Is it risky to manage Seller Central from China? Any IP issues, account suspension problems, or login restrictions? How safe is using VPN?\n* Can I pay suppliers using Wise or PayPal while being in China? What?s the best and safest way to send money to suppliers from China?\n* What visa is best if I want to stay for one year?\n* What other big challenges or problems should I expect while running Amazon FBA from China?\n\nIf you have actual experience doing this, please share in the comments. It would help me a lot.\n\nThanks in advance!"}]}
